# Brambleguard Veteran: on turn three Black Lotus is a free spell, the Veteran mana 1-3 and Elvish Mystic mana 4, so its
# controller expends 4 (CR 700.14). Raccoons they control as it resolves - the Veteran and Bakersbane Duo, a Squirrel
# Raccoon - get +1/+1 and vigilance until end of turn; Llanowar Elves (an Elf) and the Mystic do not. The Duo's own expend
# ability gives it another +1/+1. Turn one's three mana are another turn's and count nothing (the count is per turn).

